{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926590/extras/a083ab728d552baa2b811b179b6e79a4.avif?t=1755276649\" width=636 height=367 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the alliance forced Fraenn K. out of the facilities, a temporary peace had formed, thus bringing so called 'minor' issues back on the table. As Fraenn was a pretty big hazard to deal with, the remaining minor issues are still big enough troubles to require your help to bargain with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form your upgraded settlements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the story of Relics of the Ancients</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain additional items in relic hunts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use additional settlement structure improvements</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3926590?t=1755276649","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3926590?t=1755276649","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926590/afa4e6d1866ace4fac4621264f4e2ff46b29da13/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755276649","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926590/afa4e6d1866ace4fac4621264f4e2ff46b29da13/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755276649","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id"